# Where to read the config from (Spiele, Logos, Sponsoren, Action_Images).
# Defaults to raw.githubusercontent.com/<owner>/wvv-posts-config/main, which serves
# published changes within seconds instead of waiting for a GitHub Pages build.
# Copy this file to .env.development.local or set it in your CI.
VITE_CONFIG_BASE_URL=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maximiliankleissl/wvv-posts-config/main

# Where to write config edits via the gateway (optional; sensible default baked in).
# VITE_WRITER_URL=https://gateway.wvv-insta-config-editor-api.workers.dev
